


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_c54683ec:



    voice "2RI_1369"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_d2283778:


    "伦似乎对阳菜的所在地有头绪。她大步大步地笔直朝那里赶去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_08baadf1:


    "目的地当然就是教堂。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_7a2512ba:



    voice "2RI_1370"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_a2790703:


    "伦用力打开门，扫视教堂内部。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_47029503:



    voice "2RI_1371"
    rin "「……！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_34c74bf0:


    "最后她发现了教堂里、演讲台后蠢蠢欲动的身影。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_a9f48be2:



    voice "2RI_1372"
    rin "「阳菜，你听我说」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_99db1cdf:


    "伦深吸一口气，朝那个身影说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_41eba392:



    voice "2RI_1373"
    rin "「你不出来也不要紧，就在那里听着。虽然我其实是想面对面好好谈谈的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_ad80fec6:


    "伦娓娓道来，语气比圣诞节那时还要平静。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_4b2d1c4a:



    voice "2RI_1374"
    rin "「被人喜欢的感觉超爽，是最能让人开心的事情」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_f83dff5d:



    voice "2RI_1375"
    rin "「阳菜总是毫无保留地向我传达着这份“喜欢”——用语言、用行动，让我沉浸在喜欢的海洋」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_f9da4dcb:



    voice "2RI_1376"
    rin "「但贪得无厌的我很快就对此习以为然，不知不觉间把阳菜的好意当做理所应当——明明我们才交往一个月！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_3c2a7e6a:



    voice "2RI_1377"
    rin "「而且我只是一味索取，自己什么也没有给你」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_42254158:



    voice "2RI_1378"
    rin "「但是，给予这件事……对我来说真的很难。我和勇敢的阳菜不同，是个胆小鬼」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_bfcbf91f:



    voice "2RI_1379"
    rin "「但是……这不过是借口」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_b87cd3c6:



    voice "2RI_1380"
    rin "「我不能只想着自己了。要为了说喜欢我的阳菜改变」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_1251285b:


    "伦慢慢迈出步伐。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_fb4e67c0:



    voice "2RI_1381"
    rin "「……还有啊，我对阳菜的变化感到害怕。没想到你会变得这么粘人嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_e42d698b:



    voice "2RI_1382"
    rin "「我一直很害怕为别人做出改变」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_5f3f1c3b:



    voice "2RI_1383"
    rin "「但和阳菜交往的时候，我发现自己更害怕对方因自己发生改变」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_390ee6d9:



    voice "2RI_1384"
    rin "「改变别人……那时我感觉到的“重量”，其实是责任啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_e2a37647:


    "伦说着，抱住了无形的某些事物。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_46e5e992:



    voice "2RI_1385"
    rin "「……但，这大概就是恋爱吧。我们并不是特例」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_28626554:



    voice "2RI_1386"
    rin "「我还是很害怕改变与被改变。但我更害怕孤独」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_ce4fb798:



    voice "2RI_1387"
    rin "「呐。所以，再次，和我一起——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_747929cf:


    "伦从口袋中取出项圈。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_68346d1c:



    voice "2RI_1388"
    rin "「过来！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_dc077a7d:


    "威风凛凛的声音响彻教堂。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_278c7e29:


    "……………"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_052e8ff9:


    "身影从演讲台后悄悄探出。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_e3aef2b8:



    voice "2RI_1389"
    rin "「我不会生气的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_693b96b7:


    "伦像是哄孩子般，柔声呼唤着阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_a2f0082c:



    voice "2RI_1390"
    rin "「诶！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_c15d4ca8:


    "窜出来的影子化作了黑色的炮弹，在处女之路上逆向直线奔跑，朝伦突进。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_8a879828:



    voice "2RI_1391"
    rin "「呜哇哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_3da817e5:


    "伦被柔软的肉团压倒，一屁股坐在地上。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_58e0c91a:



    voice "2RI_1392"
    rin "「好危险啊……你这、这样、也太心急了吧。真是毛手毛脚的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_879f9c19:



    voice "2RI_1393"
    rin "「“毛手毛脚”！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_f64a2b55:



    voice "2AR_0002"
    arthur "「汪！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_dfd593b0:


    "“毛手毛脚”，真相大白。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_4baf50e2:



    voice "2RI_1394"
    rin "「亚、亚瑟！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_d52bec1c:


    "伦误以为是阳菜而搭话的对象其实是条狗——是浅生家的宠物狗，亚瑟。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_dc1d0926:



    voice "2RI_1395"
    rin "「等等……别舔了！呀啊别冲我喘气！等、等等等等～～！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_32057b0b:


    "亚瑟只是在兴奋地闹着玩，但被它压住后可没法轻易起身。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_f3a54153:



    voice "2HI_1396"
    hina "「停下！趴下！」" (show_name="？？？")


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_2b4a46ff:


    "教堂后方传来尖锐的指示声。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_d603f80c:


    "亚瑟立马退下，趴在地上做出待机的姿势。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_e912fb10:



    voice "2RI_1396"
    rin "「……！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_b9fd17f5:


    "伦从亚瑟的体重中解放出来，总算是直起了上半身，朝声音传出的方向望去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_449112e5:


    "门口照射进来的光线中，走动着小小的人影——"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_ba4ac66a:



    voice "2HI_1397"
    hina "「好的好的，亚瑟是个乖孩子哦——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_91782555:


    "阳菜抚摸着老实趴在地上的亚瑟的背部。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_78792ac9:



    voice "2RI_1397"
    rin "「阳菜你去哪了？阳菜你干什么去了？阳菜这怎么回事啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_9f834d42:


    "伦一股脑地问了一堆问题。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_db73c455:



    voice "2HI_1398"
    hina "「阳菜阳菜地叫个不停，好吵啊。你先起来吧。还是说你想一直坐在地上？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_4ed88246:



    voice "2RI_1398"
    rin "「啊……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_09b06e90:



    voice "2HI_1399"
    hina "「我在找亚瑟。浅生和我联系——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_82183c2e:



    voice "2RI_1399"
    rin "「对了！亚瑟！你为什么会在这里啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_ab952e55:



    voice "2AR_0002"
    arthur "「汪？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_b72b7be2:



    voice "2HI_1400"
    hina "「别问了听我说！我会好好说明的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_fc983403:



    voice "2RI_1400"
    rin "「啊，好的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_d8c12682:



    voice "2HI_1401"
    hina "「浅生联系我说亚瑟趁她不注意逃跑了。店里在忙抽不开身，所以没法出去追」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_dcc18b9d:



    voice "2RI_1401"
    rin "「所以就让阳菜去找了？搜索范围也太大了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_17f8a5d2:



    voice "2HI_1402"
    hina "「没。只拜托了我在学校找」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_27970136:



    voice "2RI_1402"
    rin "「为什么？从店里到这里挺远的吧？而且还要走山道啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_2d86a0eb:



    voice "2HI_1403"
    hina "「根据浅生的说法，是因为亚瑟很喜欢我和伦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_01308777:



    voice "2RI_1403"
    rin "「是这样吗，你？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_f64a2b55_1:



    voice "2AR_0002"
    arthur "「汪！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_b5e2ad5c:


    "它承认了——看上去是。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_b4e44e84:



    voice "2HI_1404"
    hina "「所以觉得可能是来了我们这」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_78c572cf:



    voice "2RI_1404"
    rin "「然后就猜对了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_4224cf57:



    voice "2HI_1405"
    hina "「是的。她是午休时联系的我。我电话打到一半就看到了像是亚瑟的身影，慌慌张张追了出去——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_258bfd85:



    voice "2RI_1405"
    rin "「……话说，这种事你应该先联系一下我吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_3a38f447:



    voice "2HI_1406"
    hina "「抱歉……光想着追就不小心忘记了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_8f728625:



    voice "2RI_1406"
    rin "「也没啥大不了的啦……我还以为你又离家出走了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_04ffdd07:



    voice "2HI_1407"
    hina "「没有啊。我们不是说好了放学后见吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_24616ecb:



    voice "2RI_1407"
    rin "「说、说的也是哦……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_980bbcae:



    voice "2HI_1408"
    hina "「你多相信一下我对你的感情呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_488ac8f4:



    voice "2RI_1408"
    rin "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_700a0c79:


    "立场又在不经意间逆转了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_9bbf89aa:



    voice "2RI_1409"
    rin "「……于是，你从哪里听起的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_0b7dd70d:



    voice "2HI_1409"
    hina "「我看到伦的背影就追过来了。所以从最开始吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_88044f71:



    voice "2RI_1410"
    rin "「唔……这不是又和之前一样了吗」"




translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_83607d9e:


    voice "2HI_1402"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_5687719f:


    hina "「没。只拜托了我在学校找」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_5f36d9d6:


    voice "2HI_1407"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_08_2f22a9d5:


    hina "「没有啊。我们不是说好了放学后见吗」"
